  "about": {
    "title": "About the Return of the Duelist set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Return of the Duelist is a Yu-Gi-Oh! TCG booster set released on 24 August 2012, in the ZEXAL era. It has 100 cards, and with the 11 other rarities there are 111 to collect in all.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 100 cards, each in its main rarity) or the <b>Master set</b> (all 111, adding the 11 other rarities).",
